ير باستخدام وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي restart-dev-containers و تحسين كفاءة عملية التطوير"},"definition":{"en":"restart-dev-containers is a skill that restarts Docker development containers, used for rebuilding containers after code changes or resolving issues with unhealthy containers","zh":"restart-dev-containers是用于重启Docker开发容器的AIエージェント","ja":"restart-dev-containersはDocker開発コンテナの再起動を支援するAIエージェントです","ko":"restart-dev-containers는 Docker 개발 컨테이너의 재시작을 지원하는 AI 에이전트입니다","es":"Un skill de agente de inteligencia artificial para reiniciar contenedores de desarrollo de Docker","fr":"Un skill d''agent d''intelligence artificielle pour redémarrer les conteneurs de développement Docker","de":"Ein Skill für KI-Agents, um Docker-Entwicklungscontainer neu zu starten","pt":"O que é restart-dev-containers? É um agente de IA que reinicia contêineres de desenvolvimento de forma eficaz","ru":"Что такое restart-dev-containers? Это ИИ агент, который перезапускает контейнеры разработки правильным образом","ar":"ما هو restart-dev-containers؟ هو وكيل ذكاء اصطناعي ي重新 تشغيل حاويات التطوير بطريقة فعالة"},"features":{"en":["Restarts Docker development containers after code changes","Resolves issues with unhealthy dev containers","Fixes ''Element not found'' errors in dev testing","Used in conjunction with ''restart-test-containers'' skill for test containers","Rebuilds containers to reflect updated code"],"zh":["支持Docker开发容器的重启","解决代码更改和编译错误的问题","用于开发环境的容器管理","防止Element not found错误","支持容器的健康检查"],"ja":["Docker開発コンテナの再起動をサポート","コード変更とコンパイルエラーの解決","開発環境のコンテナ管理","Element not foundエラーの防止","コンテナの健全性チェックをサポート"],"ko":["Docker 개발 컨테이너의 재시작 지원","코드 변경과 컴파일 에러 해결","개발 환경의 컨테이너 관리","Element not found 에러 방지","컨테이너의 健全性 체크 지원"],"es":["Reinicia contenedores de desarrollo de Docker","Ideal para después de cambios de código","Soluciona problemas de contenedores no sanos","Evita errores de compilación","Funciona con Docker DEVELOPMENT containers"],"fr":["Redémarre les conteneurs de développement Docker","Idéal après des changements de code","Résout les problèmes de conteneurs non sains","Évite les erreurs de compilation","Fonctionne avec les conteneurs de développement Docker"],"de":["Startet Docker-Entwicklungscontainer neu","Ideal nach Codeänderungen","Löst Probleme mit nicht gesunden Containern","Vermeidet Kompilierungsfehler","Funktioniert mit Docker-Entwicklungscontainern"],"pt":["Reinicia contêineres de desenvolvimento após alterações de código","Melhora a eficiência do processo de desenvolvimento","Resolve problemas de contêineres não saudáveis","Soluciona erros de compilação durante testes de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Перезапускает контейнеры разработки после изменений кода","Повышает эффективность процесса разработки","Решает проблемы с не здоровыми контейнерами","Исправляет ошибки компиляции во время тестирования разработки"],"ar":["يعيد تشغيل حاويات التطوير بعد تغييرات في الكود","يحسن كفاءة عملية التطوير","يحل مشاكل الحاويات غير الصحية","يصلح أخطاء الترجمة أثناء اختبار التطوير"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use restart-dev-containers","restart-dev-containers setup guide","docker development container restart","restart-dev-containers vs restart-test-containers","restart-dev-containers install","docker container restart best practices"],"zh":["restart-dev-containers","AIエージェント","Docker开发容器","代码更改","编译错误","Element not found错误","容器管理","开发环境"],"ja":["restart-dev-containers","AIエージェント","Docker開発コンテナ","コード変更","コンパイルエラー","Element not foundエラー","コンテナ管理","開発環境"],"ko":["restart-dev-containers","AI 에이전트","Docker 개발 컨테이너","코드 변경","컴파일 에러","Element not found 에러","컨테이너 관리","개발 환경"],"es":["reiniciar contenedores de desarrollo","docker desarrollo","contenedores de desarrollo","agente de inteligencia artificial","herramientas de desarrollo","desarrollo de software","docker containers"],"fr":["redémarrer les conteneurs de développement","docker développement","conteneurs de développement","agent d''intelligence artificielle","outils de développement","développement de logiciels","conteneurs docker"],"de":["neustarten von Entwicklungscontainern","docker entwickler","entwicklungscontainer","KI-Agents","Entwicklungstools","Softwareentwicklung","docker container"],"pt":["restart-dev-containers","contêineres de desenvolvimento","IA para desenvolvimento","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","otimização de contêineres","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["restart-dev-containers","контейнеры разработки","ИИ для разработки","инструменты разработки","оптимизация контейнеров","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["restart-dev-containers","حاويات التطوير","الذكاء الاصطناعي للتطوير","أدوات التطوير","تحسين الحاويات","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"DarkMonkDev","repo":"WitchCityRope","repoPath":"DarkMonkDev/WitchCityRope","stars":1,"forks":1,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T06:06:45Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"restart-dev-containers","description":"Restarts WitchCityRope Docker DEVELOPMENT containers using the CORRECT procedure. Handles shutdown, rebuild with dev compose overlay, health checks, and compilation verification. Ensures environment is ready for development. SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH for dev container restart process. Uses -p witchcityrope-dev for isolation from test containers.","bodyPreview":"# Restart Dev Containers Skill\n\n**Purpose**: Restart Docker DEVELOPMENT containers the RIGHT way - this is the ONLY correct procedure.\n\n**CRITICAL**: This skill is for DEVELOPMENT containers only. For TEST containers, use `restart-test-containers` skill.\n\n**When to Use**:\n- After code changes that need container rebuild\n- When dev containers are unhealthy\n- When \"Element not found\" errors appear in dev testing (usually means compilation errors)\n\n**When NOT to Use**:\n- For test containers - use `","body":"# Restart Dev Containers Skill\n\n**Purpose**: Restart Docker DEVELOPMENT containers the RIGHT way - this is the ONLY correct procedure.\n\n**CRITICAL**: This skill is for DEVELOPMENT containers only. For TEST containers, use `restart-test-containers` skill.\n\n**When to Use**:\n- After code changes that need container rebuild\n- When dev containers are unhealthy\n- When \"Element not found\" errors appear in dev testing (usually means compilation errors)\n\n**When NOT to Use**:\n- For test containers - use `restart-test-containers` instead\n- For running E2E tests - use `test-environment` skill instead\n\n## CONTAINER ISOLATION\n\n**CRITICAL**: Dev and test containers are isolated using different project names:\n\n- **Dev containers**: `-p witchcityrope-dev`\n- **Test containers**: `-p witchcityrope-test`\n\nThis prevents operations on one environment from affecting the other.\n\n## SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH\n\n**This skill is the ONLY place where dev container restart procedure is documented.**\n\n**If you find container restart instructions elsewhere:**\n1. They are outdated or wrong\n2. Report to librarian for cleanup\n3. Use THIS skill instead\n\n**DO NOT duplicate this procedure in:**\n- Agent definitions\n- Lessons learned (reference this skill instead)\n- Process documentation (reference this skill instead)\n\n---\n\n## The Correct Process\n\n**Common mistakes** (DO NOT do these):\n- Running `docker-compose up -d` without the dev overlay\n- Running compose without `-p witchcityrope-dev` (will interfere with test containers)\n- Running `./dev.sh` then immediately running tests without checking compilation\n\n**Instead**: Always use `execute.sh` -- it handles overlay, project isolation, compilation checks, and health verification.\n\n---\n\n## How to Use This Skill\n\n**Executable Script**: `execute.sh`\n\n```bash\n# From project root\nbash .claude/skills/restart-dev-containers/execute.sh\n\n# Skip confirmation prompt (for automation)\nSKIP_CONFIRMATION=true bash .claude/skills/restart-dev-containers/execute.sh\n```\n\n**What the script does**:\n1. Shows pre-flight information (purpose, when/when NOT to use)\n2. Requires confirmation before proceeding (skippable with env var)\n3. Validates prerequisites (Docker running, project root, dev overlay exists)\n4. Stops existing dev containers (using `-p witchcityrope-dev`)\n5. Starts containers with dev overlay (`docker-compose.yml + docker-compose.dev.yml`)\n6. Checks for compilation errors in Web and API containers\n7. Verifies health endpoints (Web, API, Database)\n8. Reports status summary\n\n**Script includes safety checks** - it will not run blindly without showing you what it''s about to do.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n```bash\n# From project root - with confirmation prompt\nbash .claude/skills/restart-dev-containers/execute.sh\n\n# For automation - skip confirmation\nSKIP_CONFIRMATION=true bash .claude/skills/restart-dev-containers/execute.sh\n```\n\n**No manual steps documented here** -- all logic lives in `execute.sh`. If the script is unavailable, read `execute.sh` directly for the correct procedure.\n\n---\n\n## Common Issues & Solutions\n\n### Issue: Containers start but tests fail\n\n**Cause**: Compilation errors in container. The skill automatically checks compilation logs and reports errors.\n\n### Issue: Port already in use\n\n**Cause**: Old containers still running or other process using ports. Check running containers and kill orphans, or use `lsof` to find what''s occupying the port.\n\n### Issue: Health checks fail after compilation succeeds\n\n**Cause**: Services need more time to initialize. The skill retries health checks for up to 60 seconds.\n\n### Issue: Test containers were deleted when restarting dev\n\n**Cause**: Missing project isolation flag. Always use this skill which includes the correct `-p witchcityrope-dev` flag.\n\n---\n\n## Integration with Agents\n\n### react-developer / backend-developer\n\n**After code changes:**\n```\nI''ll restart dev containers to apply my changes.\n```\n*Skill is invoked automatically*\n\n**Result**: Code changes applied, compilation verified\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\nWhen run via Claude Code, skill returns:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"skill\": \"restart-dev-containers\",\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2025-12-01T15:30:00Z\",\n  \"containers\": {\n    \"running\": 3,\n    \"expected\": 3,\n    \"healthy\": true\n  },\n  \"compilation\": {\n    \"web\": \"clean\",\n    \"api\": \"clean\"\n  },\n  \"healthChecks\": {\n    \"web\": \"healthy\",\n    \"api\": \"healthy\",\n    \"database\": \"healthy\"\n  },\n  \"readyForTesting\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Environment ready for development and testing\"\n}\n```\n\nOn failure:\n```json\n{\n  \"skill\": \"restart-dev-containers\",\n  \"status\": \"failure\",\n  \"error\": \"Compilation errors in web container\",\n  \"details\": \"TypeError: Cannot read property ''foo'' of undefined at line 42\",\n  \"action\": \"Fix source code and restart again\"\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **restart-test-containers**: For restarting TEST containers (uses `-p witchcityrope-test`)\n- **test-environment**: For running E2E tests (calls restart-test-containers internally)\n\n---\n\n## Maintenance\n\n**This skill is the single source of truth for DEV container restart.**\n\n**To update the restart procedure:**\n1. Update THIS file only\n2. Test the new procedure\n3. DO NOT update process docs, lessons learned, or agent definitions\n4. They should reference this skill, not duplicate it\n\n---\n\n## Version History\n\n- **2026-02-24**: Removed test-server from dev compose\n  - test-server does not belong in dev environment; test infrastructure is handled by restart-test-containers skill\n  - Reduced expected container count from 4 to 3 (postgres, api, web)\n- **2025-12-02**: Removed seed data check\n  - Was failing silently due to wrong database password\n  - Unnecessary since API auto-seeds on startup and health checks verify connectivity\n- **2025-12-01**: Added `-p witchcityrope-dev` project isolation\n  - Added reference to `restart-test-containers` skill\n- **2025-11-04**: Created as single source of truth for container restart\n\n---\n\n**Remember**: This skill is executable automation. Run it, don''t copy it.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T07:11:30.988Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring efficient Docker container management and restart capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高效Docker容器管理和重启能力的开发代理。","ja":"Dockerコンテナの効率的な管理および再起動機能が必要な開発エージェントに適しています。","ko":"효율적인 Docker 컨테이너 관리 및 재시작 기능이 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo que requieren una gestión eficiente de contenedores Docker y capacidades de reinicio.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une gestion efficace des conteneurs Docker et des capacités de redémarrage.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsmittel benötigende effiziente Docker-Container-Verwaltung und Neustartfunktionen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem gerenciamento eficiente de contêineres Docker e capacidades de reinicialização.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих эффективного управления контейнерами Docker и возможностей перезапуска.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يتطلب إدارة كفؤة ل-contêineres Docker وقدرات إعادة التشغيل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to restart Docker development containers correctly, utilizing Docker protocols to rebuild containers after code changes, fix unhealthy containers, and resolve compilation errors, ensuring seamless development testing and Element not found error resolution.","zh":"赋予代理重启Docker开发容器的能力，利用Docker协议在代码更改后重建容器，修复不健康的容器，并解决编译错误，确保无缝的开发测试和元素未找到错误解决。","ja":"Docker開発コンテナを正しく再起動できるようにエージェントをEmpowerし、コードの変更後にコンテナを再構築し、不健康なコンテナを修復し、コンパイルエラーを解決し、シームレスな開発テストと要素が見つからないエラーの解決を保証します。","ko":"에이전트가 Docker 개발 컨테이너를 올바르게 재시작할 수 있도록Empower하고, 코드 변경 후 컨테이너를 재구성하고, 불건강한 컨테이너를 수정하며, 컴파일 오류를 해결하여 무결점 개발 테스트와 요소가 발견되지 않는 오류 해결을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a reiniciar correctamente los contenedores de desarrollo Docker, utilizando protocolos Docker para reconstruir contenedores después de cambios de código, solucionar contenedores no saludables y resolver errores de compilación, garantizando pruebas de desarrollo y resolución de errores sin problemas y resolución de errores de elemento no encontrado.","fr":"Permet aux agents de redémarrer correctement les conteneurs de développement Docker, en utilisant les protocoles Docker pour reconstruire les conteneurs après des modifications de code, résoudre les conteneurs non sains et résoudre les erreurs de compilation, assurant ainsi des tests de développement et une résolution d''erreurs sans problème et une résolution d''erreurs d''élément non trouvé.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Docker-Entwicklungscontainer richtig neu zu starten, indem Docker-Protokolle verwendet werden, um Container nach Codeänderungen neu zu erstellen, nicht gesunde Container zu beheben und Kompilierungsfehler zu lösen, und so eine nahtlose Entwicklungstestung und Fehlerbehebung bei Element-Fehlern sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a reiniciar contêineres de desenvolvimento Docker corretamente, utilizando protocolos Docker para reconstruir contêineres após alterações de código, corrigir contêineres não saudáveis e resolver erros de compilação, garantindo testes de desenvolvimento sem interrupções e resolução de erros de elemento não encontrado.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью перезапускать контейнеры разработки Docker правильно, используя протоколы Docker для перестроения контейнеров после изменений кода, исправления нездоровых контейнеров и решения ошибок компиляции, обеспечивая бесперебойное тестирование разработки и решение ошибок не найденного элемента.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إعادة تشغيل حاويات التطوير Docker بشكل صحيح، مستخدمًا بروتوكولات Docker لإعادة بناء الحاويات بعد تغييرات الشفرة، وإصلاح الحاويات غير الصحية، وحل أخطاء الترجمة، وضمان اختبار التطوير السلس وрешение أخطاء العنصر غير الموجود."},"useCases":{"en":["Restarting dev containers after code updates","Debugging unhealthy dev containers","Resolving Element not found errors in dev testing"],"zh":["代码更新后重启开发容器","调试不健康的开发容器","解决开发测试中的元素未找到错误"],"ja":["コードの更新後に開発コンテナを再起動する","不健康な開発コンテナをデバッグする","開発テストでの要素が見つからないエラーを解決する"],"ko":["코드 업데이트 후 개발 컨테이너 재시작","개발 컨테이너의 불건강한 문제 해결","개발 테스트에서 요소가 발견되지 않는 오류 해결"],"es":["Reiniciar contenedores de desarrollo después de actualizaciones de código","Depurar contenedores de desarrollo no saludables","Resolver errores de elemento no encontrado en pruebas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Redémarrer les conteneurs de développement après des mises à jour de code","Déboguer les conteneurs de développement non sains","Résoudre les erreurs d''élément non trouvé dans les tests de développement"],"de":["Entwicklungscontainer nach Code-Aktualisierungen neu starten","Nicht gesunde Entwicklungscontainer debuggen","Element-Fehler in der Entwicklungstestung lösen"],"pt":["Reiniciar contêineres de desenvolvimento após atualizações de código","Depurar contêineres de desenvolvimento não saudáveis","Resolver erros de elemento não encontrado em testes de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Перезапуск контейнеров разработки после обновлений кода","Отладка нездоровых контейнеров разработки","Решение ошибок не найденного элемента при тестировании разработки"],"ar":["إعادة تشغيل حاويات التطوير بعد تحديثات الشفرة","تصحيح الحاويات غير الصحية للتطوير","حل أخطاء العنصر غير الموجود في اختبار التطوير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Exclusively for development containers","Requires Docker environment","Not applicable for test containers, use restart-test-containers skill instead"],"zh":["仅适用于开发容器","需要Docker环境","不适用于测试容器，请使用restart-test-containers技能"],"ja":["開発コンテナのみに適用可能","Docker環境が必要","テストコンテナには適用できません。restart-test-containersスキルを使用してください"],"ko":["개발 컨테이너에만 적용 가능","Docker 환경 필요","테스트 컨테이너에는 적용할 수 없습니다. restart-test-containers 스킬을 사용하십시오"],"es":["Exclusivamente para contenedores de desarrollo","Requiere entorno Docker","No aplicable para contenedores de prueba, use la habilidad restart-test-containers en su lugar"],"fr":["Exclusivement pour les conteneurs de développement","Nécessite un environnement Docker","Non applicable pour les conteneurs de test, utilisez la compétence restart-test-containers à la place"],"de":["Ausschließlich für Entwicklungsmittel","Benötigt Docker-Umgebung","Nicht anwendbar für Testcontainer, verwenden Sie stattdessen die Fähigkeit restart-test-containers"],"pt":["Exclusivamente para contêineres de desenvolvimento","Exige ambiente Docker","Não se aplica a contêineres de teste, use a habilidade restart-test-containers em vez disso"],"ru":["Исключительно для контейнеров разработки","Требует среды Docker","Не применяется к контейнерам тестирования, используйте вместо этого навык перезапуска контейнеров тестирования"],"ar":["حصرًا ل-contêineres التطوير","يتطلب بيئة Docker","لا ينطبق على حاويات الاختبار، استخدم بدلاً من ذلك مهارة إعادة تشغيل حاويات الاختبار"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"50316dd7e2dce79a472604e49dfed13b6948f61c19bb2a1caead9b681030a48e","qualityScore":57}');
