d''outils d''IA qui permet la création de pipelines de LLM avec des chaînes de type sécurisé","de":"wesichain-core ist ein Satz von KI-Tools, der die Erstellung von LLM-Pipelines mit sicherem Typ-Chainings ermöglicht","pt":"O wesichain-core é uma biblioteca Rust para criar pipelines LLM compostas e personalizadas","ru":"Wesichain-core - это библиотека Rust для создания составных LLM-пipelines","ar":"وesichain-core هو مكتبة رست لإنشاء خطوط أنابيب LLM القابلة للتركيب"},"features":{"en":["Build composable LLM pipelines with type-safe chaining","Implement custom components that plug into the Runnable ecosystem","Add retry logic, streaming, or error handling to your chains","Create reusable, testable LLM components in Rust using async_trait","Utilize Tokio for async operations and WASM for web assembly support","Integrate with Langchain for large language model capabilities"],"zh":["构建可复用和类型安全的LLM管道","支持异步和可重试的工作流","实现自定义组件以插入Runnable生态系统","添加重试逻辑、流媒体或错误处理到链中","创建可重用和可测试的LLM组件在Rust中"],"ja":["再利用可能で型安全なLLMパイプラインを構築","非同期と再試行可能なワークフローをサポート","カスタムコンポーネントを実装してRunnableエコシステムにプラグイン","チェーンにリトライロジック、ストリーミング、またはエラーハンドリングを追加","Rustで再利用可能でテスト可能なLLMコンポーネントを作成"],"ko":["재사용 가능하고 유형 안전한 LLM 파이프라인 구축","비동기 및 재시도 가능한 워크플ロー 지원","사용자 지정 컴포넌트를 구현하여 Runnable 생태계에 플러그인","체인에 재시도 논리, 스트리밍 또는 오류 처리 추가","러스트에서 재사용 가능하고 테스트 가능한 LLM 컴포넌트 생성"],"es":["Creación de pipelines de LLM con encadenamiento de tipo seguro","Implementación de componentes personalizables con Runnable","Adición de lógica de reintentos y manejo de errores a las cadenas","Creación de componentes de LLM reutilizables y probables en Rust","Integración con Tokio y WASM para capacidades asíncronas"],"fr":["Création de pipelines de LLM avec des chaînes de type sécurisé","Implémentation de composants personnalisables avec Runnable","Ajout de logique de réessai et de gestion d''erreurs aux chaînes","Création de composants de LLM réutilisables et testables en Rust","Intégration avec Tokio et WASM pour des capacités asynchrones"],"de":["Erstellung von LLM-Pipelines mit sicherem Typ-Chainings","Implementierung von benutzerdefinierten Komponenten mit Runnable","Hinzufügen von Wiederholungslogik und Fehlerbehandlung zu den Ketten","Erstellung von wiederverwendbaren und testbaren LLM-Komponenten in Rust","Integration mit Tokio und WASM für asynchrone Fähigkeiten"],"pt":["Criação de pipelines LLM compostas com type-safe chaining","Implementação de componentes personalizados com Runnable","Adição de lógica de retry, streaming e tratamento de erros","Criação de componentes LLM reutilizáveis e testáveis em Rust","Integração com ReAct workflows resumáveis"],"ru":["Создание составных LLM-пipelines с type-safe chaining","Реализация пользовательских компонентов с Runnable","Добавление логики повторных попыток, потоковой передачи и обработки ошибок","Создание многоразовых и тестируемых LLM-компонентов на Rust","Интеграция с возобновляемыми рабочими процессами ReAct"],"ar":["إنشاء خطوط أنابيب LLM القابلة للتركيب مع ربط آمن","تنفيذ مكونات مخصصة مع Runnable","إضافة 논理 إعادة المحاولة والبث والتعامل مع الأخطاء","إنشاء مكونات LLM قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام والاختبار في رست","التكامل مع سير عمل ReAct القابلة لإعادة التشغيل"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use wesichain-core","wesichain-core alternative","wesichain-core install","wesichain-core vs langchain","what is wesichain-core","wesichain-core setup guide","wesichain-core rust example","wesichain-core tokio integration","wesichain-core wasm support"],"zh":["Wesichain-Core","LLM代理","Rust","异步工作流","类型安全","可重试","AIエージェント","LLM管道"],"ja":["Wesichain-Core","LLMエージェント","Rust","非同期ワークフロー","型安全","再試行可能","AIエージェント","LLMパイプライン"],"ko":["Wesichain-Core","LLM 에이전트","러스트","비동기 워크플ロー","유형 안전","재시도 가능","AI 에이전트","LLM 파이프라인"],"es":["agentes de inteligencia artificial","pipelines de LLM","encadenamiento de tipo seguro","componentes personalizables","Runnable","Rust","Tokio","WASM","IA","herramientas de inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["agents d''IA","pipelines de LLM","chaînes de type sécurisé","composants personnalisables","Runnable","Rust","Tokio","WASM","IA","outils d''intelligence artificielle"],"de":["KI-Agents","LLM-Pipelines","sichere Typ-Chainings","benutzerdefinierte Komponenten","Runnable","Rust","Tokio","WASM","KI","KI-Tools"],"pt":["wesichain-core","pipelines LLM","type-safe chaining","Runnable","ReAct workflows","Rust","desenvolvimento de AI","ferramentas de AI","agentes de AI"],"ru":["wesichain-core","составные LLM-пipelines","type-safe chaining","Runnable","ReAct рабочие процессы","Rust","разработка ИИ","инструменты ИИ","ИИ агенты"],"ar":["wesichain-core","خطوط أنابيب LLM","ربط آمن","Runnable","سير عمل ReAct","رست","تصميم الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"wesichain","repo":"wesichain","repoPath":"wesichain/wesichain","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-19T09:35:05Z","topics":["agents","ai","async","langchain","llm","rust","tokio","wasm"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wesichain-core","description":"|","bodyPreview":"## When to Use\n\nUse wesichain-core when you need to:\n- Build composable LLM pipelines with type-safe chaining\n- Implement custom components that plug into the Runnable ecosystem\n- Add retry logic, streaming, or error handling to your chains\n- Create reusable, testable LLM components in Rust\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```rust\nuse wesichain_core::{Runnable, RunnableExt, WesichainError};\n\n// Define a simple Runnable\nstruct AddPrefix;\n\n#[async_trait::async_trait]\nimpl Runnable<String, String> for AddPrefix {","body":"## When to Use\n\nUse wesichain-core when you need to:\n- Build composable LLM pipelines with type-safe chaining\n- Implement custom components that plug into the Runnable ecosystem\n- Add retry logic, streaming, or error handling to your chains\n- Create reusable, testable LLM components in Rust\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```rust\nuse wesichain_core::{Runnable, RunnableExt, WesichainError};\n\n// Define a simple Runnable\nstruct AddPrefix;\n\n#[async_trait::async_trait]\nimpl Runnable<String, String> for AddPrefix {\n    async fn invoke(&self, input: String) -> Result<String, WesichainError> {\n        Ok(format!(\"pre-{input}\"))\n    }\n\n    fn stream(&self, input: String) -> BoxStream<''_, Result<StreamEvent, WesichainError>> {\n        // Implementation for streaming\n        futures::stream::iter(vec![\n            Ok(StreamEvent::FinalAnswer(format!(\"pre-{input}\")))\n        ]).boxed()\n    }\n}\n\n// Chain multiple runnables together\nlet chain = AddPrefix.then(Uppercase).then(AddSuffix);\nlet result = chain.invoke(\"hello\".to_string()).await?;\n// Result: \"PRE-HELLO-suf\"\n```\n\n## Key Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Runnable Implementation\n\n```rust\nuse wesichain_core::{Runnable, StreamEvent, WesichainError};\nuse futures::stream::BoxStream;\n\n#[async_trait::async_trait]\nimpl Runnable<Input, Output> for MyComponent {\n    async fn invoke(&self, input: Input) -> Result<Output, WesichainError> {\n        // Transform input to output\n        Ok(transform(input))\n    }\n\n    fn stream(&self, input: Input) -> BoxStream<''_, Result<StreamEvent, WesichainError>> {\n        // Emit streaming events\n        futures::stream::iter(events).boxed()\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Chain Composition with .then()\n\n```rust\nuse wesichain_core::RunnableExt;\n\n// Compose runnables into a pipeline\nlet pipeline = PromptTemplate::new(\"Hello {name}\")\n    .then(DummyLlm)\n    .then(SimpleParser)\n    .with_retries(2);\n\nlet result = pipeline.invoke(json!({\"name\": \"World\"})).await?;\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Streaming Events\n\n```rust\nuse wesichain_core::Runnable;\nuse futures::StreamExt;\n\nlet mut events = chain.stream(\"input\".to_string());\nwhile let Some(event) = events.next().await {\n    match event? {\n        StreamEvent::ContentChunk(chunk) => print!(\"{}\", chunk),\n        StreamEvent::ToolCallStart { name, .. } => println!(\"Calling: {}\", name),\n        StreamEvent::FinalAnswer(answer) => println!(\"\\nFinal: {}\", answer),\n        _ => {}\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 4: Error Handling with WesichainError\n\n```rust\nuse wesichain_core::WesichainError;\n\n// Match on specific error types\nmatch result {\n    Err(WesichainError::MaxRetriesExceeded { max }) => {\n        eprintln!(\"Failed after {} attempts\", max);\n    }\n    Err(WesichainError::LlmProvider(msg)) => {\n        eprintln!(\"LLM error: {}\", msg);\n    }\n    Err(WesichainError::ParseFailed { output, reason }) => {\n        eprintln!(\"Parse failed on ''{}'': {}\", output, reason);\n    }\n    Ok(value) => println!(\"Success: {}\", value),\n}\n```\n\n## Golden Rules\n\n1. **Always implement both `invoke` and `stream`** - Even if streaming just returns a single FinalAnswer event\n2. **Use `RunnableExt` for composition** - The `.then()` method is the primary way to chain components\n3. **Prefer typed errors** - Return `WesichainError` variants instead of generic strings for better error handling\n4. **Make components Send + Sync** - All Runnables must be thread-safe for async execution\n5. **Use `with_retries()` for flaky operations** - Wrap external API calls (LLMs, tools) with retry logic\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n- **Implementing `stream` that ignores the input** - Always use the input parameter in your stream implementation\n- **Forgetting Send + Sync bounds** - Runnables must be thread-safe; use Arc for shared state\n- **Mixing error types** - Convert external errors to WesichainError using `?` or `.map_err()`\n- **Blocking in async methods** - Use `tokio::task::spawn_blocking` for CPU-intensive work\n- **Not handling cancellation** - Check for cancellation tokens in long-running operations\n\n## Resources\n\n- Full guide: `/Users/bene/Documents/bene/python/rechain/wesichain/.worktrees/ai-skills-docs/docs/plans/2026-02-02-wesichain-phase-1-core-implementation-plan.md`\n- Crate: `wesichain-core`\n- Key traits: `Runnable`, `RunnableExt`, `RetryExt`\n- Key types: `WesichainError`, `StreamEvent`, `Value`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T03:59:02.820Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing composable LLM pipelines with type-safe chaining in Rust","zh":"适合需要在Rust中使用可组合LLM管道和类型安全链式的AI代理","ja":"Rustで組み立て可能なLLMパイプラインとタイプセーフなチェインを必要とするAIエージェントに適しています","ko":"Rust에서 조합 가능한 LLM 파이프라인과 타입 안전 체이닝이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan tuberías LLM componibles con encadenamiento seguro de tipos en Rust","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin de pipelines LLM composable avec chaînage sécurisé de types en Rust","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die komponierbare LLM-Pipelines mit typsicherer Verkettung in Rust benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de pipelines LLM compostos com encadeamento de tipo seguro em Rust","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым требуются составные конвейеры LLM с безопасной цепочкой типов в Rust","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يحتاج إلى خطوط أنابيب LLM القابلة للتركيب مع ربط آمن للنوع في Rust"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build custom components with retry logic, streaming, and error handling, leveraging Runnable and WesichainError for robust LLM chains, all while utilizing Rust for implementation","zh":"赋予代理构建自定义组件的能力，包括重试逻辑、流处理和错误处理，利用Runnable和WesichainError来构建强大的LLM链，同时利用Rust进行实现","ja":"エージェントがRunnableとWesichainErrorを利用して強力なLLMチェーンを作成し、Rustを使用して実装することで、カスタムコンポーネントを構築し、リトライロジック、ストリーミング、エラーハンドリングを実現できます","ko":"Runnable과 WesichainError를 사용하여 강력한 LLM 체인을 구축하고, Rust를 사용하여 구현함으로써 에이전트가 커스텀 컴포넌트를 구축하고, 재시도 로직, 스트리밍, 오류 처리를 구현할 수 있습니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir componentes personalizados con lógica de reintento, transmisión y manejo de errores, aprovechando Runnable y WesichainError para cadenas LLM robustas, todo mientras utiliza Rust para la implementación","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire des composants personnalisés avec une logique de réessai, de diffusion en continu et de gestion des erreurs, en exploitant Runnable et WesichainError pour des chaînes LLM robustes, tout en utilisant Rust pour la mise en œuvre","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, benutzerdefinierte Komponenten mit Wiederholungslogik, Streaming und Fehlernbehandlung zu erstellen, indem sie Runnable und WesichainError für robuste LLM-Ketten nutzen, während sie Rust für die Implementierung verwenden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir componentes personalizados com lógica de repetição, transmissão e tratamento de erros, aproveitando Runnable e WesichainError para correntes LLM robustas, tudo isso utilizando Rust para implementação","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать пользовательские компоненты с логикой повторения, потоковой передачи и обработки ошибок, используя Runnable и WesichainError для прочных цепочек LLM, все это при использовании Rust для реализации","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من بناء مكونات مخصصة مع منطق إعادة التشغيل و البث و معالجة الأخطاء، مستفيداً من Runnable و WesichainError من أجل سلاسل LLM قوية، و كل ذلك باستخدام Rust للتطبيق"},"useCases":{"en":["Building reusable LLM components","Implementing custom components with type-safe chaining","Adding retry logic and error handling to LLM pipelines"],"zh":["构建可重用LLM组件","实现具有类型安全链式的自定义组件","为LLM管道添加重试逻辑和错误处理"],"ja":["再利用可能なLLMコンポーネントを構築する","タイプセーフなチェインを備えたカスタムコンポーネントを実装する","LLMパイプラインにリトライロジックとエラーハンドリングを追加する"],"ko":["재사용 가능한 LLM 컴포넌트 구축","타입 안전 체이닝을 갖춘 커스텀 컴포넌트 구현","LLM 파이프라인에 재시도 로직과 오류 처리 추가"],"es":["Construir componentes LLM reutilizables","Implementar componentes personalizados con encadenamiento seguro de tipos","Agregar lógica de reintento y manejo de errores a las tuberías LLM"],"fr":["Construire des composants LLM réutilisables","Implémenter des composants personnalisés avec chaînage sécurisé de types","Ajouter une logique de réessai et de gestion des erreurs aux pipelines LLM"],"de":["Wiederverwendbare LLM-Komponenten erstellen","Benutzerdefinierte Komponenten mit typsicherer Verkettung implementieren","Wiederholungslogik und Fehlernbehandlung zu LLM-Pipelines hinzufügen"],"pt":["Construir componentes LLM reutilizáveis","Implementar componentes personalizados com encadeamento de tipo seguro","Adicionar lógica de repetição e tratamento de erros a pipelines LLM"],"ru":["Построение многократно используемых компонентов LLM","Реализация пользовательских компонентов с безопасной цепочкой типов","Добавление логики повторения и обработки ошибок в конвейеры LLM"],"ar":["بناء مكونات LLM قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","تنفيذ مكونات مخصصة مع ربط آمن للنوع","إضافة منطق إعادة التشغيل و معالجة الأخطاء إلى خطوط أنابيب LLM"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rust programming knowledge","Limited to building composable LLM pipelines"],"zh":["需要Rust编程知识","仅限于构建可组合LLM管道"],"ja":["Rustプログラミングの知識が必要","組み立て可能なLLMパイプラインの構築のみ"],"ko":["Rust 프로그래밍 지식 필요","조합 가능한 LLM 파이프라인 구축만 가능"],"es":["Requiere conocimientos de programación en Rust","Limitado a la creación de tuberías LLM componibles"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en programmation Rust","Limité à la création de pipelines LLM composable"],"de":["Benötigt Rust-Programmierkenntnisse","Begrenzt auf die Erstellung von komponierbaren LLM-Pipelines"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de programação em Rust","Limitado à construção de pipelines LLM compostos"],"ru":["Требует знаний программирования на Rust","Ограничен построением составных конвейеров LLM"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بلغة برمجة Rust","محدود ببناء خطوط أنابيب LLM القابلة للتركيب"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"697cf0b2c7f3f5636ad0a5436d202950dea1342b1f8714cc89827e1ee6b9ac61","qualityScore":57}');
