apacitor CI/CD? Это инструмент автоматизации для мобильных приложений","ar":"ما هو Capacitor CI/CD? هو أداة توفير وقت وعمالة في بناء وتجربة وتشغيل التطبيقات المتنقلة"},"features":{"en":["Automates building and testing of Capacitor apps using GitHub Actions","Supports automated deployment to main and develop branches","Utilizes YAML workflows for customized CI/CD pipelines","Enables app signing automation for secure releases","Integrates with GitHub Actions for streamlined workflow management"],"zh":["自动化构建和部署","支持GitHub Actions","自动签名和发布","多分支支持（main、develop）","环境变量配置（NODE_VERSION）"],"ja":["自動化されたビルドとデプロイ","GitHub Actionsのサポート","自動署名とリリース","マルチブランチサポート（main、develop）","環境変数の設定（NODE_VERSION）"],"ko":["자동화된 빌드 및 배포","GitHub Actions 지원","자동 서명 및 릴리스","다중 분기 지원（main、develop）","환경 변수 설정（NODE_VERSION）"],"es":["Automatización de builds con GitHub Actions","Soporte para Node.js versión 20","Despliegue automático en ramas main y develop","Automatización de firma de aplicaciones","Lanzamientos automatizados"],"fr":["Automatisation des builds avec GitHub Actions","Prise en charge de Node.js version 20","Déploiement automatique sur les branches main et develop","Automatisation de la signature des applications","Lancements automatisés"],"de":["Automatisierung von Builds mit GitHub Actions","Unterstützung für Node.js Version 20","Automatisches Deployment auf main- und develop-Branches","Automatisierung der App-Signierung","Automatisierte Releases"],"pt":["Automação de construção e teste de aplicações móveis","Integração com GitHub Actions","Suporte a Node.js v20","Automação de implantação de aplicações","Suporte a workflows personalizados"],"ru":["Автоматизация xây dựng и тестирования мобильных приложений","Интеграция с GitHub Actions","Поддержка Node.js v20","Автоматизация развертывания мобильных приложений","Поддержка пользовательских workflows"],"ar":["توفير وقت وعمالة في بناء وتجربة التطبيقات المتنقلة","التكامل مع GitHub Actions","دعم Node.js v20","توفير وقت وعمالة في تشغيل الت